        <detaileddescription>
<para>Clears the map, then walks <computeroutput>state</computeroutput> via <computeroutput><ref refid="classjam_1_1Model_1a59b57627d856a11d756eabe1690a7213" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Model::applyFunctionRecursively</ref></computeroutput> reading the <computeroutput>ID::graphics</computeroutput> property (<computeroutput><ref refid="classjam_1_1Model_1ad7d29cc11027835e39f6bb1c5bbe3677" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Model::toStringArray</ref></computeroutput>) on each node. For each non-empty filename builds a callback that fires <computeroutput>state.sendPropertyChangeMessage</computeroutput> on the matching identifier — either the button-state suffix (when present in <computeroutput><ref refid="structjam_1_1map_1_1ButtonState" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::map::ButtonState</ref></computeroutput>) or the bare stem. Called at the end of every <computeroutput><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_theme_1a6d4ca39c5481082070ba546736a2f25b" kindref="member">loadFromPath()</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
